{"pageid":2709,"title":"Corpse Flower","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Corpse Flower</span>","revid":18917,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Corpse Flower</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/03/Corpse_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20240417190425\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Corpse Flower\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/03/Corpse_Flower.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240417190425\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/03/Corpse_Flower.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240417190425 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/03/Corpse_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20240417190425 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Corpse Flower\" width=\"270\" height=\"223\" data-image-key=\"Corpse_Flower.png\" data-image-name=\"Corpse Flower.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Wastes\" title=\"Acid Wastes\">Acid Wastes</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dye</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"Corpse flowers are rare and foul-smelling plants that bloom infrequently.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The corpse flower glows a faint green and is fairly large. This flower can be found at the highest peak around the altar in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a>. It temporarily can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Grimestone\" title=\"Grimestone\">Grimestone</a> cave in <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>. This flower out of every rare flower has the slowest respawn time and grows in the least abundance. Used to craft the <a href=\"/wiki/Petalfall\" title=\"Petalfall\">Petalfall</a>. It can be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\"><b>Jer Junkman</b></a> for 250$ per Corpse Flower. It can be turned into Dye by using a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Press_Machine\" title=\"Press Machine\">Press Machine</a></b>.\n</p><p>When put into a <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, the fill level increases by ~27.46% per flower.\n</p><p>Also seems to be based off the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rafflesia\">Rafflesia</a> plant\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903003533\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 66/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019447/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.809      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   37.809      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2709-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903003533 and revision id 18917. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Acid Wastes","exists":true},{"title":"Acidlands","exists":true},{"title":"Composter","exists":true},{"title":"Grimestone","exists":true},{"title":"Jer Junkman","exists":true},{"title":"Mike's Mines","exists":true},{"title":"Petalfall","exists":true},{"title":"Press Machine","exists":true}],"images":["Corpse_Flower.png"]}
